step 32 "@pulse until 400 is DEAD!!"
pulses 25
out god "\n\rThe septon's beating misses Rambler.\n\rThe septon's beating does UNSPEAKABLE things to Pickpocket!\n\rPickpocket is stunned, but will probably recover.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe septon's beating MASSACRES Rambler!\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe septon's beating *** DEVASTATES *** Rambler!\n\rRambler is DEAD!!\n\rRambler got toasted by the septon at The Temple Of Mota [room 3001]\n\rYou hear Rambler's death cry.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9"
out ser "\n\rYou hear someone's death cry.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 99mv> \xff\xf9"
out ram "\n\rThe septon's beating misses you.\n\rThe septon's beating does UNSPEAKABLE things to Pickpocket!\n\rPickpocket is stunned, but will probably recover.\n\rThe septon parries your attack.\n\rThe septon is in excellent condition. \n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe septon's beating MASSACRES you!\n\rThat really did HURT!\n\rThe septon parries your attack.\n\rThe septon is in excellent condition. \n\r\n\r<11hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe septon's beating *** DEVASTATES *** you!\n\rYou have been KILLED!!\n\r\n\r\n\r<1hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9"
out pick "\n\rThe septon's beating misses Rambler.\n\rThe septon's beating does UNSPEAKABLE things to you!\n\rYou are stunned, but will probably recover.\n\r\n\r<0hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9"
